			<title>Madonna to attend the UK Premiere of W.E. Next Week in London</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/385-madonna-to-attend-the-uk-premiere-of-we-next-week-in-london.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/385-madonna-to-attend-the-uk-premiere-of-we-next-week-in-london.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p><strong>DrownedMadonna.com</strong> heard that there will be a <strong>UK Premiere</strong> of <strong>W.E.</strong> next week in <strong>London</strong> and <strong>Madonna</strong> is expected to attend the event.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>We got news that the <strong>UK Premiere</strong> of <strong>W.E.</strong> will take place on <strong>Wednesday, January 11, 2012</strong>, at 6:00PM (GMT) at <strong>Odeon</strong>, Kensington High Street,<strong> London</strong>. Director <strong>Madonna</strong>, and actors <strong>Andrea Riseborough</strong> and <strong>James D'Arcy</strong> are expected to attend the premiere.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>We remind you that <strong>W.E.</strong> will be released in the <strong>UK</strong> on January 20, 2012.</p></div><div class="K2FeedTags"><ul><li>W.E.</li><ul></div>]]></description>
